// squad_skirmish — basic single-target ranged strike. AbilityId 1.
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 5, range: 8.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Damage { amount: 12.0 }] }
//
// Used by every Soldier (no role gate at the .ability layer; the verb's
// `when` clause does the role/team filtering). The pair-field score
// `(150 - target.hp)` is the multi-target argmax driver — picks the
// lowest-HP enemy in range.

ability Strike {
    target: enemy
    range: 8.0
    cooldown: 5
    hint: damage

    damage 12.0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
